# Hosts that reject the link checker rather than actually being broken.
# Each of these resolves fine in a browser; they return 401/403 to
# non-browser user agents, or 429 when several links to the same host are
# checked in one run. Verify by hand before adding anything here.

linkedin.com
reddit.com

# 403 to non-browser user agents
caltech.edu
statistics.fas.harvard.edu
zhihu.com

# 429 — the film links in the year-in-review posts all hit one host
douban.com
